    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classic score attack arcade games, Bone March is a single-stage arena survival game that sets the player a simple task: Last as long as you can.\u00a0 Bone March features two-joystick differential steering &quot;tank&quot; controls, which combines coordinated inputs from both joysticks to move in intuitive and versatile ways.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838210/extras/825b6a204a9595d25c9fdaff56c8ff55.avif?t=1755474194\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p>",
